# Identity, appearance and disguise
#
# Never owl:sameAs for these. Maṇimēkalai looks like Kāyasaṇṭikai, she isn't her.

@prefix iy:   <https://example.org/manichchilambu#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix crm:  <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/> .
@prefix crminf: <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/extensions/crminf/> .
@prefix prov: <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#> .
@prefix time: <http://www.w3.org/2006/time#> .

<https://example.org/manichchilambu/m12_identity> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Identity, appearance and disguise" ; owl:imports <https://example.org/manichchilambu> .
# Closest standard term: owl:differentFrom

iy:Disguise a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf iy:Event .
iy:Appearance a owl:Class .

iy:looksLike a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:samePersonAs a owl:ObjectProperty .
iy:differentFromKnown a owl:ObjectProperty .
